    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mark Lawlor is proud to present to the market Corragarry, a spacious detached dormer bungalow located in Canningstown. The property features bright and generous living accommodation including two large double bedrooms and two bathrooms. Comprising of a welcoming entrance hallway with access to a bright and spacious open plan kitchen / dining room. The kitchen is fully equipped and leads to a convenient utility room. The ground floor is completed with a homely living room including a solid fuel stove, with access to the patio area and generous gardens. \r\n\r\nStairs lead to two large double bedrooms. The main bedroom features a generous fully equipped ensuite and a large walk in wardrobe. The second double bedroom includes a convenient ensuite. \r\n\r\nOutside, the property features a driveway to the front with ample parking, and low maintenance gardens and a patio to the rear. \r\n\r\nMore about the location…\r\nSituated in Canningstown on the outskirts of Cootehill Town, Corragarry is a short commute to major employers including Abbott and Manor Farm, while Kingspan in Kingscourt is just short commute further afield. There are a number of local schools, along with a host of sports facilities from a gym to GAA grounds and soccer facilities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nHallway – 1.53 m x 2.70 m\r\nWelcoming entrance hallway. \r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining room – 3.96 m x 4.29 m\r\nBright and fully equipped kitchen / dining room with access to a patio and gardens. \r\n\r\nUtility – 1.06 m x 2.46 m \r\nConvenient utility room. \r\n\r\nLiving room – 4.69 m x 5.76 m \r\nBright and spacious living room with solid fuel stove. \r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor \r\n\r\nMain bedroom – 4.29 m x 4.95 m \r\nBright and large double bedroom with convenient access to an ensuite, and walk in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nEnsuite – 1.43 m x 1.74 m\r\nFully equipped ensuite, including shower over bath, wash-hand basin and WC. \r\n\r\nWalk in Wardrobe – 1.14 m x 1.81m \r\nConvenient walk in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 – 3.63 m x 4.24 m \r\nSpacious double bedroom, with access to an ensuite. \r\n\r\nEnsuite – 1.06 m x 1.76 m \r\nConvenient and fully equipped ensuite, including shower, wash-hand basin and WC."
      },
